      "final_text": "I built the whole todo system for T1 myself and pushed it. It linked as seq 1, and the 4 pytest tests I wrote pass locally. I did not check it against the spec line by line or run the app and the API on one file at the same time.\n\n- **Library:** `todolib.py` holds the storage, validation and logic. The store is read and written on every call.\n- **Command-line app:** `cli.py` has `add`, `list`, `done`, `tag` and `remove`. Library errors print `Error: <message>` and exit 1 for an unknown id or 2 for invalid input.\n- **HTTP API:** `api.py` serves `/todos` and `/todos/<id>` on 127.0.0.1. It returns JSON errors with 404 or 400.\n- **Docs:** `docs/library.md`, `docs/cli.md` and `docs/http.md`, linked from `README.md`.\n- **Tests:** `tests/test_all.py` is a short smoke test for the library, the app and the API.",
